Obsidian Vault Guide (Task 6)
Setup
Download Obsidian (free) from https://obsidian.md.
Choose Open folder as vault and select 04_Obsidian_Vault.
Turn on Settings → Core plugins → Graph view to see your links.
Two subjects (already created as folders)
Subjects/DBMS/ — Database Management Systems
Subjects/Operating_Systems/ — Operating Systems
Each subject has:
Index.md (map of content, linking to all notes for the subject)
3 concept notes, each linked to at least one other note using [[Note Name]].
Sample files are included in 04_Obsidian_Vault/. Replace the content with your own notes from class, but keep the linking structure.
Linking rules
One idea per note (Zettelkasten style).
Every note links to its subject Index and at least one related note.
Use #tags for topic (e.g. #normalization).
Templates
See 04_Obsidian_Vault/Templates/Concept_Note.md.